              "image_path": "images/page_4_table_2.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>Drawing any number from 2 to 10 from a deck of 52 cards</td><td>More likely: There are 36 cards in a deck of 52 cards with numbers from 2 to 10.</td></tr><tr><td>Choosing a red sweet from a bag of all red sweets</td><td>Certain: All the sweets are red.</td></tr></table>"
            }
